      value: Satellite Selection
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[0].teachingInfo
      value: Welcome new recruit! I am Handler One and I will be introducing you
        to everything that you need to know. Your task is simple, get the beam of
        light to the destination through any means necessary. I have allocated you
        a budget in order to accomplish this, the less you use the higher score you
        get! Good luck, I have high hopes for you. - Handler One
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[0].usingSpriteA
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[1].teachingInfo
      value: You can find level information and settings in the top right of your
        display, hitting the Info icon will open it. Settings are saved automatically
        when leaving the settings screen.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[1].usingSpriteA
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[1].usingSpriteB
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[2].teachingInfo
      value: In each level you will find a drone at the centre of your screen. This
        will be your eyes, moving it around will change what you can see.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[2].usingSpriteA
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[2].usingSpriteB
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[3].teachingInfo
      value: This is your starting point, this is where your beam of light begins.
        Make note of the colour, this will be helpful in later levels.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[3].usingSpriteA
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[3].usingSpriteB
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[4].teachingInfo
      value: "This is your goal, getting the beam of light here. Due to security
        reasons, you must hold the beam of light over the destination in order to
        \u2018activate\u2019 it. If the beam moves off the destination the connection
        will be lost and the destination will become \u2018inactive\u2019. Once all
        destinations are active, the level ends. You can see how many destinations
        need activating and your progress in the top left of your display. Selecting
        the WiFi icon will open the panel and display more information. The destination
        will notify you when it has received light for a duration."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[4].usingSpriteA
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[4].usingSpriteB
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[5].teachingInfo
      value: As an employee of Elysian Photonics, we have provided you with exclusive
        access to our state of the art matter printer, Elysia. On the right side
        of your display, clicking the shopping basket icon will open the shop. Clicking
        on one of the dedicated tabs will present you with satellites you may purchase.
        Purchased satellites are then created by Elysia. Note that you will need
        to move created satellites out of the printing area in order for Elysia to
        create new ones.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[5].usingSpriteA
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[5].usingSpriteB
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[6].teachingInfo
      value: "Satellites come in a variety of forms and have different interactions.
        Selecting a satellite will present its information in the bottom left of
        your screen (document icon) and a control panel. Use of the control panel
        is optional, you can use your keyboard for the same results. Some satellites
        don\u2019t give you the ability to move them!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[6].usingSpriteA
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[6].usingSpriteB
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[7].teachingInfo
      value: This is a standard reflection satellite. It follows the principle of
        specular reflection and will absorb a small amount of light. Light will reflect
        at the same angle that it is hit at. Weak signals are not accepted by the
        destination so be wary!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7544388290579987951, guid: eafc6440e8a55484db4d89c2bfcd8739, type: 3}
      propertyPath: teachingElements.Array.data[7].usingSpriteA
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
